      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../mapping/Associations.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.mapping\"><code>Associations</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a>, <a href=\"../../core/UriToEntityConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core\"><code>UriToEntityConverter</code></a>, <a href=\"../mapping/LinkCollector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.mapping\"><code>LinkCollector</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/support/RepositoryInvokerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvokerFactory</code></a>,\n<a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.LookupObjectSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule.LookupObjectSerializer</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/mvc/RepresentationModelProcessorInvoker.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.mvc\"><code>RepresentationModelProcessorInvoker</code></a> and <a href=\"../EmbeddedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc\"><code>EmbeddedResourcesAssembler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a href=\"../mapping/Associations.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.mapping\"><code>Associations</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a>、<a href=\"../../core/UriToEntityConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core\"><code>UriToEntityConverter</code></a>、<a href=\"../mapping/LinkCollector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.mapping\"><code>LinkCollector</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/repository/support/RepositoryInvokerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>RepositoryInvokerFactory</code></a>、<a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.LookupObjectSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule.LookupObjectSerializer</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/mvc/RepresentationModelProcessorInvoker.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.mvc\"><code>RepresentationModelProcessorInvoker</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../EmbeddedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc\"><code>EmbeddedResourcesAssembler</code></a>，创建一个新的 <a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule</code></a>。",
