      "source": "A <code>ValueDeserializerModifier</code> that registers a custom <a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.UriStringDeserializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule.UriStringDeserializer</code></a> for association\nproperties of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "一个用于为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 的关联属性注册自定义 <a href=\"PersistentEntityJacksonModule.UriStringDeserializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>PersistentEntityJacksonModule.UriStringDeserializer</code></a> 的 <code>ValueDeserializerModifier</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
